      "cooked": "<p>Hello there fellow forum users. and hopefully people from greater then games.</p><p><span>i have recently ordered this insert&nbsp;http://www.boardgamegeek.com/geeklist/152772/uk-based-card-storage-game-components<br><span alt=\"\" class=\"broken-image\" title=\"This image is broken\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-unlink svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#unlink\"></use></svg></span></span><br>&nbsp;</p><p><span>for my LCG games from Fantasy Flight. now it would be undiscribably awesome if this insert would be supported in a next box for sentinels of the multiverse.</span></p><p>im sure every card would fit sleeved or not sleeved + all the tokens. however the box needs a little bit more height for the dividers. (the insert comes with deviders but there actually just seperators)</p><p>here is an example of sleeved cards from android netrunner.</p><p><span alt=\"\" class=\"broken-image\" title=\"This image is broken\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-unlink svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#unlink\"></use></svg></span></p>",
